== History==
2016
*The Mega Minion [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 19/9/2016, in the [[Version History#September 2016 Update (19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]].
*On 21/9/2016, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (21/9/2016)|maintenance break]], added a Mega Minion offer in the [[Shop]], selling 100 Mega Minion cards.
*On 30/11/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (30/11/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Mega Minion's damage by 6% and increased its attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1.3 seconds).
2017
*On 23/1/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/1/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the Mega Minion's damage by 4% and increased its attack time interval to 1.5 seconds (from 1.4 seconds).
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Mega Minion from Royal Arena to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Mega Minion's attack time interval to 1.6 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Mega Minion's range to 1.6 tiles (from 2 tiles), now classified as Melee: Long.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Mega Minion from [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse]] to Barbarian Bowl.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 28/4/2022, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Mega Minions's card info screen.
2023
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Mega Minion's attack time interval to 1.5 seconds (from 1.6 seconds).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Mega Minion's damage by 0.32%.
2026
*On 2/2/2026, the February 2026 Update changed the Mega Minion's card image.

